<title>SPAIN: Spain CNMV recognises S&amp;P ratings for OTC risks.</title>
<headline>Spain CNMV recognises S&amp;P ratings for OTC risks.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Stock Market Commission CNMV said on Wednesday it had recognised Standard &amp; Poor's Ratings Services and Standard &amp; Poor's Espana as specialised rating agencies for counterparty risk in the over-the-counter market.</p>
<p>Earlier this month, the CNMV also authorised IBCA Rating Espana, the Spanish unit of the European credit rating, to assign ratings in derivatives traded in the over-the-counter market.</p>
<p>--Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
</text>
